WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:06,100
The animal spirits under floating corpse grass and polluted grass plants will become crazy for pollution.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:24,650
Senior, what should we do now?

3
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,450
Do you want them to be left alone?

4
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,250
These cows ate contaminated corpse grass

5
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,850
Can the meat still be eaten?

6
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,050
I can't control that much anymore

7
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,850
If you really can't eat it, then sell it to those people in the fish and chip country.

8
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:36,650
There is no reason why so much meat cannot be eliminated

9
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:44,380
Senior, you have thought of a way
